OL,3,CCharity smashes #10k appeal after
OL,4,Cthousands of bees invade headquarters
OL,6,FA Hampshire charity has praised the
OL,7,F"overwhelming" support of the local
OL,8,Fcommunity after raising #10,000 in
OL,9,Funder 24 hours to repair bee damage at
OL,10,Fits New Forest headquarters.
OL,12,FStaff at the Minstead Trust were
OL,13,Fforced to close the main reception at
OL,14,FGrade II-listed Minstead Lodge, near
OL,15,FLyndhurst, after a massive colony of
OL,16,Fbees invaded the building, causing
OL,17,Fstructural damage and sending honey
OL,18,Fdripping through the ceiling.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
