OL,3,CCharity smashes #10k appeal after
OL,4,Cthousands of bees invade headquarters
OL,6,FFaced with an unexpected repair bill
OL,7,Fnot covered by insurance, bosses
OL,8,Flaunched an emergency online appeal to
OL,9,Fsafely relocate the insects and
OL,10,Frestore the 1830s property.
OL,12,FThe local community rallied around,
OL,13,Fhelping the charity smash its #10,000
OL,14,Ftarget in less than a day through
OL,15,Fdirect donations and social media
OL,16,Fshares.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
