OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786036714
OL,3,CCharity smashes #10k appeal after
OL,4,Cthousands of bees invade headquarters
OL,6,FThe successful campaign has allowed
OL,7,Fspecialist teams to humanely move the
OL,8,Fhive, deep-clean the historic space,
OL,9,Fand fully reopen the reception area to
OL,10,Fthe public.
OL,12,FIn a statement on their campaign page,
OL,13,Fthe charity added: "The response has
OL,14,Fbeen overwhelming. Whether you
OL,15,Fdonated, shared the appeal or helped
OL,16,Fspread the word, thank you. Your
OL,17,Fsupport means we can cover the costs
OL,18,Fof safely removing the bees, repairing
OL,19,Fthe damage and getting the Lodge back
OL,20,Fup and running.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
