OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786036714
OL,3,CCharity smashes #10k appeal after
OL,4,Cthousands of bees invade headquarters
OL,6,F"Most importantly, you've helped us
OL,7,Fovercome an unexpected challenge and
OL,8,Fcontinue focusing on creating
OL,9,Fopportunities for neuro-disabled
OL,10,Fpeople to live their life, their way."
OL,12,FThe Minstead Trust currently supports
OL,13,Faround 600 neurodivergent adults and
OL,14,Findividuals with learning disabilities
OL,15,Facross the region, helping them
OL,16,Fdevelop essential skills to live more
OL,17,Findependently.
